{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1269,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f066e0bcb091d743f73cf033",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次休假的时候，\r\n我要和小雪一起研究怎么打扮哦！\r\n训练员也要一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c0a7f6c24d4b301e7437dece7cdba391092f593632514a7d08a94e4a6ced58b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1adf7da43577781ca2b7b00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "模仿小丸善会不会看起来比较成熟啊？\r\n超赞的～！\r\n……好像不太对？",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c8487fbbc334b57a2920bc94880fa06e1a33aa2161657d8a76420d887d2b30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab48dfa3d39789b0d5ddbec2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，是飞机云！\r\n会不会刚好是爸爸的飞机啊！\r\n诶嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e40fe00c13c7faf0981d46d9d6a0f339633ee3a60ad07a6617c64312afa202ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4652a78dbc1e880861ddde9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噗──噗──！\r\n训练员，\r\n什么事都不做太无聊了啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3154d4a6aa2ea4ac30cbb1b97d506bc9f364ee9eaa7652a8040b8767cc329375",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81be1cc869f8f626e91d138b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要在胜者舞台上\r\n击落所有粉丝的心哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "570aa6360626cccc7f565d09a8c8c476da50cdf53cc88506d625843b0e44a6c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a30d4ffdd53d9a067e248fbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Live的衣服是很成熟的设计呢！\r\n大胆中还带着高雅的感觉！\r\n穿上这个感觉会很耀眼哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea80caeffe30245b4161c17fa283f1358e91cd98a4cf834d10f209325c7b68d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e04553cb946c8dfecfcd762",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我感觉会咻～一下就飞走咯！\r\n训练员一定要好好跟上来哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd069adc62a04dff929c25e7c24e70bc8460476b89eb3380c1eef57205e6bfbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecf71d3f8809ba9ebd67ba88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服很帅气吧──♪\r\n你现在如果称赞我帅气，\r\n就判定你Maya的三级检定合格哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83d3cd0506f6d2ad630712c19e7946ebfe716ff69de423ffba919065c1c87b3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a657341029de8523c2f0a2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……昨天跟小帝王一起熬夜了～\r\n虽然很想睡觉，\r\n但觉得自己有点像大人的感觉……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b59803d3aa816abbfe6dcb29740467f614b8041a1a0f210632c108ef23ad9f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8769403357d9a778e8d75de9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「早安Maya☆」怎么样怎么样？我\r\n打算跟Mabe亲一起让这句流行起来～！\r\n训练员也可以一起说哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acff89068e39bbc9f003a60bba2f62fe29bab27454e52adf121552f0dcf9011",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73a9b9d9a0a00af6b8b6245f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～救救Maya……！太想变大人……\r\n居然变成老婆婆了……！\r\n……咦，是梦？好、好险啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9702b39a2f26b0a25026d94094c9a26d0bc62d79a9e0e8b9fbc02584d99280d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0ccd11bed986087fb3eb0b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天给人一种万物起始的期待感呢！\r\n就在这舒服的阳光下，\r\nTake Off去寻找开心的事情吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3491a9dcd39d334690936bd230c3c6fb3ac6f6e045a850065c48521357ddab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2912399ac0b418c62a4b2139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说我说，如果要在学园放烟火，\r\n首选是不是顶楼啊？或是教室里☆\r\n……都不行？小气诶～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e497003b8ffd02fc4e10abe705ac84ea9ee76f395814e4f5a611716f45d1fab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19ed453327e4d20406c585c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有圣蹄祭跟万圣节对吧？\r\n可以赏月、又可以赏红叶！\r\n秋天真的有很多令人期待的事情呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf7d9842cf66851a09c361d7b736253248b5f3944425f09d0c3e7a937e01d40d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36a1963c7ecec50be1cfbf9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打、打疫苗……？\r\n不要不要不要不要～！！\r\n我绝对不要打针～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5dc3a27acd1750630d1864ad9259cf0471225327c5d935127ce7fadeb82a790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b475f1ab94009794163357",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿！如何？我姿势摆得很棒吧☆\r\n这是我拜托城市教我的成熟姿势呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccf1a9ee2be28310a54d2d3425dca5a0389a4403e1f84e98c7d18606b6a6a099",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3cb53c181c0245d75e661b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一直感觉到米浴在看我！\r\n她该不会……\r\n是想和Maya玩结婚扮家家酒吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "145f09fee02fdb6a80f7b3b677a9400eec0c6b026d5ce2e658fc15125512dbe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e37857d812d8df50798f5a60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "婚宴的餐桌礼仪是很重要的！\r\n所以我正在跟小麦昆……不对，\r\n我正在跟麦昆老师学习！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b159a92a3e9a33a263d16bfe592fcf1dc2e00d6a0370dc80ee6e4ec9a6c6052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f66fe6747f884688375da7bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我让白仁看了我的礼服……\r\n结果她竟然喊说「眼睛好痛」！\r\n老实称赞我可爱就好了说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4818d730d3b26f5d9b59a65a277ef98ab8faff1732513b76c506eb1d44cb044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc2f6ecbe8428bd105b89d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！来上传照片到Umasta☆\r\n训练员，可以跟我合照吗？\r\n就当作是分享幸福给大家嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc6d403bd842103710cd3f19e15dc92f4d431731aa699b87a6b1a7f27a991f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff14f935509757fba17bc7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……\r\n今天为了做便当所以很早起。\r\n……诶嘿嘿，好好期待中午吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "66578f142c07d8cee2da335694ebad1d4bafe68d1e8b2f0422ac318305b3bee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15832eab9940c62936b1c66d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的点心就决定是蛋糕了！\r\n穿这套礼服我就想要吃蛋糕嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "430421461f3bbf15a55e16598c88aa5bbb69a9b84552a90af029dd3f8e3a6775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ba8cdb5eac2b4ce80d8c3e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦──♪无论时间来到几点，\r\nMaya的礼服都不会消失喔！\r\n因为这象征了我们的「约定」嘛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "24c3aa7322d10dbf53764b750c7b2ff459ee8605f7a311999c96572e81d5e9e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:352ea50266b6157d0ce08512",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，训练员。\r\n你的头上有花瓣呢～！\r\n刚好跟Maya配一对诶☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c0eeca90534f5aded7b884e0c77087ac6a0db655097755e2f0ea073a799ed6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9eedb836e6f4a83635966b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皮肤好刺痛……\r\n防晒乳都掉光了。\r\n再去让帝王帮我擦一次好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90ee0897a4b27e97e1994dbb544d065a39edc7deb64bf4f9b1b94c0b1a02f72a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a02a8a66b30e811cbe69598f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天花草的色调感觉很成熟呢！\r\n忧愁又沉稳～！\r\nMaya也想要抛出这种成熟的捧花看看♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e504db8c3b9281b8df59af45234fdc7e328638b0d422fcb3a3596057f88888",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1e3c01e9b7bd0efa7bc5d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等下雪天，地上积雪之后……\r\n我们就一起来堆雪人吧！\r\n我和训练员一起「携手合作」♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc9b03840d64fb0350b971cf5f580476c05ccb1361ca599c034e300046df4110",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae5c82cf93d8617eeb085e20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天我把穿礼服的照片传给了爸爸，\r\n结果他竟然就大哭了～\r\n……是可爱到让人想哭的程度吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52bb8ab2c99194afec959a16d1a23d653ee56aac0b6778894e5daebeaa41c80a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfa132e75fc3fed6ddf3edd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya想要变得更加耀眼动人！\r\n因为我想要变成照耀训练员、\r\n照耀大家的太阳嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd76a3c6607fa10908d65a7bb45eb1bb68a5a2dfb312ac35bd9e58afd6e28a66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca150f1ec31221c906e47be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "白仁就像猫一样！\r\n『明明不让人摸……\r\n却又会待在身边！』类似这样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5b90a367cd9f63be25193b9f8454bdb94548a2e8489d85ecde31b0c97a22a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d63b3de21ce780d4ac8619d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya穿成这个样子后，\r\n小素好像就变得不太镇定了！\r\n欸嘿，我要再靠近一点喵~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4cfb0fac127ee7cfd685fb0e153752f7b8437f8483af36a5823ca716b059cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70ce79875bb337854fffb88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『对不同动物的拟态……应该会\r\n非常可爱！』……欸嘿嘿嘿☆\r\n小莱斯也是Maya的俘・虏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02621018210f445b9be685f8baf71fb445755f6e9c79c7776c585be0d8dc699f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f8390d36df06baced03438b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小帝王的吉他弹得很好！\r\nMaya兴致勃勃配合着的时侯……\r\n富士前辈还乱入了！……欸嘿♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b978fb416dcc8f3f892bec4d26f776e7804d3e735b8d2a03e3fba3c3c4883a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b182a54ba1a00e26dfb8805c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸他啊，很~喜欢摇滚！\r\n开车一起去兜风的时候，\r\nMaya也学会了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "756fdbce1bac9f72fba14f8fc44460a42e60051e3b95891ff6b04fa2e152b1b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a92a27d9975400a3b1403f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天和Maya一起去约会看电影吧！\r\n要配合衣服氛围的话……\r\n哥特恐怖什么的？呀~☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7c90214679dc5dcc6c7ef61db155bf49c6ca3842bf5ffdbb4ea27b22aa6c4bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c623e5c3358cf3e32f92b6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya小猜谜~！\r\n这件衣服上有几只猫猫呢？\r\n快点快点，来找找看吧~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "daed80f342820f80eb038f3e6490da4ac8aca53d84ceb875a657044d105685df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aae86cf5f5bd3f28c00b04fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你喜欢平常的Maya吗？还是说……\r\n喜欢融化在黑夜中有着渐变发色的，\r\n成熟的Maya~？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9deec568cb5e2d390ec676cc85e4f3ad20a353e539858a6259077997af20254",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a61924841417e4c46c75fcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说春天是猫猫恋爱的季节~！\r\n……Maya的恋情，你很在意吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a12d87daf92f98a6528a5bc8b0d66cd5a217b29a7b7bbc5e8004cd6f0a4a8003",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdc597548acab71b79049f72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想吃冰淇淋啊！可以的吧？\r\n太阳这么刺眼~猫猫也会受不了的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b25ad6037cf5c3023524e71ab700fa1661fcef30e95870aa7ba62340f2d64a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3d1f33ac0db7c73c1077642",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说亚马逊前辈烤了南瓜派！\r\n难得的派对……得打扮一下才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6c02870cf9168150433fea2c5f68ed8cde8e26cd5ec9d624058d904c6f7466e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9545afd60ef6994518d96f79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "松软的帽子可以保护耳朵！\r\n即使是在风很冷的赛场，\r\n也能保证可爱又温暖~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86be63ced7c076250c6892af20950951266c1e075f9cd1bfade6039f10c48cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b5ceebbba5c2cfa5c755b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "RUN RUN!胸前的铃铛RING\r\nRING♪不管是比赛还是训练，\r\n都不要把目光从Maya身上移开哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd940b718d6324a170c650e35d9a94e02028c208a20b2cb53bdd7bdddf20fc86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50056a27a61ac98055e3d1a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼♪\r\n猫猫链条是展现成熟可爱的要点☆\r\n训练员也一起来……Rock you!",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b99a0e987b9167e55f7073ccdada81463293dce6419a4c5457e024a66bc3d92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cfeb30c9afbb5dad44c23b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟训练员一起训练就会很开心！\r\n所以就会有想要努力的感觉哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2ef86cd5b1406745ea7e42e856396d3830957607b762612434c5d23744f35c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efb50078437847ffa9166cc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5cca6b23a11354d81064b55655ba4a571b6f902dbe2c6b2ff8852bd9068bc51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca171d1a885371ad8d42de5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya会加油的！\r\n你一定要好好看着我哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3c39736c87342bdf088c97cdfd1320cc4b552a44c7c6e81d87812a30fb2bcd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b3cd1d2484d9a57847da23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快点快点快点～！\r\n快点开始训练了嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "239e95ef44feaa4750a6cfed06ed82eca949762360ba6e59f36e4ec2cc54fc4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9973a330329f7abf67c784f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！\r\nMaya随时都可以起飞哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94618df6dac9b9cb4b93669bc9f344a065e0c5797f560c6af2170d5913cc0b3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6bec9f22810c70406696152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不可以让Maya感觉到腻哦？\r\n虽然我觉得\r\n跟训练员在一起是不会腻的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45bf9687ccb852ccecd6d0d86d80614c87bbae0ae27305930739b0fb7f7003a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6861a1a18b34a6f5dee889ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以期许Maya有更优秀的表现哦？\r\nYou Copy？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee6750903953dde0c9aa0bb49dad588f4cb5a356e9f06fb6aaa1be1ad50dbcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e11451ddf4ab6195cf6dd38e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "视线良好！目标瞄准！\r\n准备好下达指示了吗？\r\n我随时都可以起飞了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da49400048f891209b2e71ed5ee6a7afa43cef0c55646328eb9ab8946e6d8478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c644da3fe831be49513e548",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么样的训练安排都轻轻松松！\r\n因为Maya什么都会嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1944ad679b16303934d432d80f0fbbac3cc7e11ab1db06dfdaa2006bf1c5994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9aaf6ca0134b7b015c35a9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿！\r\n好想要赶快一起走上胜利之路哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58266d4ddc943148871504f2025e67c02df5dcccef90612ec01be52ca0d52e1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83dd266b122acda05cdc623c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya要成为配得上闪亮礼服的\r\n耀眼动人的自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d6db050793f305c6a8615c55714da16e8baad65a7af07c4c5597896d13d8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8220aff12cd4a632569532",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！\r\n打扮过的Maya可是跟平常不一样的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a5a39f3ffe436eee8920d969f4973638503b6e663bb084413a5e66e0c75adee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3064ab7e23212d7105e53335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幸福的旅程！\r\n我们一定能办到的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "61955daaa8629d638b6e5154a7fe8f2b7f81e3b2c76f1776eb00904e4765ce7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b6c6ef6238d93eed627a577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya不对神起誓……\r\n我对训练员发誓！\r\n无论什么困难我们都能一起克服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd89138555f903fc599f3364e83ffa9cb0a9437af5684f3d794bce6e0fb3f2b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62a17de36c61c3e8f2d9af34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望训练员可以耐心等到\r\nMaya变成成熟大人的那一天……\r\n再一起盛装打扮，可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44058fe49fed71d47516640eb2a50a66370f2764897618355b9cd225d9aea0a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6351bd778a5e1a94bc2a5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你刚刚看Maya看得入迷了吧！\r\n被我看穿咯！\r\n因为我们就是来吸引目光的嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e679b684906a506e2f6d6b7680dd47f6a53bc042f5b422cf4e41a82517301a3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e21a61ab02d2f4a687c1ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美甲做好了！\r\n双马尾的高度也很合适！\r\n随时都可以出发哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "beefb14905e8ee7078e6bae2146c7a9dd0dd3e43bd53c47a248cbc3a9b9f6451",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7143fc515bb53302e5c06d9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要像猫猫一样柔软……\r\n不能忘记这一点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1a5e495ff84ccdd0a118d99bf93e60d11136c04dd9476fce2cec95e53efeace",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd988ef4e3456ab928535870",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练不是一个人的事，\r\n而是两个人的交流……对吧！\r\n就拜托你来引领Maya啦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36538fb5c4d9d8d523c450894d8970f26bb0c93e83f514a2d6ad16981b1a8cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c7e144bc170940d6fbfa00d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，要做什么呢~？\r\n不管什么安排我都能\r\n以喷气式飞机般的速度完成哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb673c20703b2f3b9cd0c9133d1f9cf2af83b459e81825313dc85c5e3feadb18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02bacc6ee9b566b36704ce67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya喵可是性情不定的！\r\n所以~……今天就去约会吧，\r\n训练员♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d8be2215633873bce4d43d5560d4db0abf58047e668eaff76775de7eda0da80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c93deddbcad291741c47148f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Nyading♪ and standby☆\r\n……这句话，两个人一起说的话\r\n搞不好会很可爱！……来，准备！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34eb89741b73484c02eda8b1b9fb778e35b98dc0531a76640ad758de02fab1ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907f6077470dbef28e2f548f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的计划~……一定是那个！\r\n训练员的想法我都能看穿喵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb34ac9a69a3e1d86e8d9b8bac3be087a2aea60a6f04a5fd1c9cce36250d5dfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0be4cbd44eabf02a97fc1033",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我进步了非常多哦！\r\n这样Maya也算是个大人了吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "557a126a8c86fe24b7ffc4ff30c0e5fdecc356cb1ece60ccd026feee2fb9fdfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9817b66d7fc74e59040fc8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啾！这是代表感谢的飞吻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6092313be70e4d56476f55923408f6dce765dbf9f5bea1d497b5c4eeaf272e12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1974877e6c10cc368c177d6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿！飞行约会大成功☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "7515eef297c964c111832142bbad2c2514bf0a2f390097b41ccbf0b33cfdad17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c59a8fb124a80ca8e1845b15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抵达终点♪Maya觉得好幸福哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "733ff3ac75b11d99db26273f40c593cef1c2efdb708e8dd850c993842f559238",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d06f211227d50ad9f9c11ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的心♡被我夺走了呢♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "3951388b46c31fc35c4436ef475fb45721443e509617a06faaf527d85621df53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d2548bce4ec3b797f989c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢喵♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa3d165b0050ae27874f4b70320686c1b0470a3f2e4efb83143c2582315ab1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40116b9505126e63ab157983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Maya好像有变强呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cb7d7f99e2d316cb0f20ef28ea9ac8cbcf3ece63e20c195f3adce78bc8387d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:519fffcd8895a88e7a70cd76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又往成熟的赛马娘更进一步了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fadfc5589434698ca47eefcec8964bdaad65dfd2f40fc4a8866f1ccfd0a7361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db951be5c683fb78e0af6bea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮，要上场了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbbd1cf7bd59ec820946825f548817ddd36ca2326589582ccca2f673c4b581c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1d1507bf8c8c13345a1102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是个可以支持别人的好女人……对吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a930ae56d95b3bdc0cc6fa90507e28e7cb4956f83e3cf352133efb6e1426fbbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217a3f4c802dca8c4a176a99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以尽情依赖Maya哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1dc4425042aede3e75b864f1373f2b3eedbcd361001d5fd6787767ce00679cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a607f06404441773ba0ddacd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魅力也要跟着提升！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79e971975849b4e108da5268e645ebf71d2bd71070e3d2663c18075ce69d7d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e99172648c9749a949b6f3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶──！这是携手合作的成果♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b0519815898021744ecf627b0dddaa6da170ee757f70ec85865761046032b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1024",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51e7ffaec25c00628d085a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "叮当──♪\r\n和Maya一起抓住耀眼的幸福吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dff47e50904cee13026c881af257458ad92161b4ced540227b0da0ddbdcf65c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
